::: flashcard
What are some challenges of retrofitting type systems?
=== key
Languages that are previously untyped:

- Encourage patterns that are type-unsound/hard-to-precisely-typed.
- Untypable patterns: `eval`.
- How to coexist with untyped code.
:::
